[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6481.27, "timestamp": "01:48:01", "text": "あるいは、メールアドレスなどを表示することもできます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6484.47, "timestamp": "01:48:04", "text": "。 たとえ時々うっかり犬が映り込んでしまうことがあっても"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6486.836, "timestamp": "01:48:06", "author": "@kaiguyniki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/f9aZERpOc1bv1JDUl12ZTXeQ7j1KdXBflkbl-6qlBLzM-hbbEQKWUlPpcJJxTU-qSUwNxrez=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "true"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6488.709, "timestamp": "01:48:08", "text": "、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6490.87, "timestamp": "01:48:10", "text": "ストリームからそれをなくすように努めてください。 たとえそれが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6495.43, "timestamp": "01:48:15", "text": "12時間の配信であっても。 ええ、そうなんです。さもないと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6498.55, "timestamp": "01:48:18", "text": "私に起こったことがあなたにも起こりますよ。 えーと、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6503.444, "timestamp": "01:48:23", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "true, never going that route and getting too comfy with sharing personal stuffs..."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6507.669, "timestamp": "01:48:27", "text": "試験用の人々の献身番号、えーと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6512.629, "timestamp": "01:48:32", "text": "日本語の試験の番号で、えーと、ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6517.43, "timestamp": "01:48:37", "text": "それをメールで送りました。私のアカデミー全体が、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6524.709, "timestamp": "01:48:44", "text": "人々がオンラインでクレイジーであることを知っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6527.51, "timestamp": "01:48:47", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6528.95, "timestamp": "01:48:48", "text": "それでは、読み込みを開始して、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6529.877, "timestamp": "01:48:49", "author": "@kaiguyniki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/f9aZERpOc1bv1JDUl12ZTXeQ7j1KdXBflkbl-6qlBLzM-hbbEQKWUlPpcJJxTU-qSUwNxrez=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oof..."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6530.629, "timestamp": "01:48:50", "text": "協議を開始します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6533.59, "timestamp": "01:48:53", "text": "ああ、絶対にそんなことはしないで。   私は全く気にしていなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6538.47, "timestamp": "01:48:58", "text": "。 しかし、最も"}]